    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/kids-toys-store/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Kids Toys Store is a colorful, playful, and fully responsive theme crafted for children-focused ecommerce businesses, toy shops, and kid-friendly brands. It’s ideal for online toy stores, baby product shops, educational toy retailers, kids gift stores, and nursery supply shops, offering a fun and engaging layout that attracts both children and parents. The theme highlights a wide range of products, including educational toys, learning games, puzzles, soft toys, action figures, dolls, board games, baby essentials, toddler toys, outdoor play equipment, creative DIY kits, birthday gifts, and school learning materials. Designed for usability and performance, Kids Toys Store features clean layouts, vibrant design elements, intuitive navigation, and visually appealing product grids to ensure a seamless shopping experience on desktops, tablets, and mobiles. Flexible templates allow showcasing featured products, seasonal collections, new arrivals, and promotional banners effectively. Customization is easy with options for colors, fonts, layouts, and homepage sections, enabling store owners to reflect their brand identity. Optimized for speed, SEO, and smooth performance, it also integrates with WooCommerce for online sales and Contact Form 7 for inquiries, support, and wholesale requests, making it a complete solution for growing online toy businesses."
    },
